<p>But how can we set up something like this? The key observation is that e=
ach node's index can be determined from its parent's index. We can derive t=
he following relationship for any node at index <code>i</code>:</p>
<ul>
<li>Its <strong>left child</strong> will be at index <strong><code>2*i + 1<=
